  "title": "Sparkling Grapefruit Pie",
  "description": "Fresh grapefruit sections are arranged in the bottom of a baked pie shell and topped with a gelatin mixture for a refreshing tart-sweet pie. Serve with whipped cream.",
  "authors": [
